  "content": "<p>這個<strong>非官方</strong>相容性修補程式確保了來自<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overflowing Bars</a></strong>模組的紋理能夠與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Excalibur</strong></a>資源包無縫整合。</p><p><strong>特色：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>重新設計了<strong>Overflowing Bars</strong>模組的HUD圖示。</li>\n<li>修復了預設<strong>Excalibur</strong>資源包中載具的HUD圖示。</li>\n</ul><p>為獲得最佳體驗，請將此修補程式與<strong>Excalibur</strong>資源包一同使用。</p><p><strong>特別感謝：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/maffhew/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Maffhew</strong></a> - 創作了<strong>Excalibur</strong>資源包。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fuzs</a></strong> - 開發了<strong>Overflowing Bars</strong>模組。</li>\n</ul><p>如果您喜歡這個相容性修補程式，歡迎分享給其他人！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
